{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u2694\ufe0f Vikings: Sex and Blood</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shipwrecked. Powerless. Left to die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You survive only because <strong>Hella, Goddess of Hell</strong>, chooses you as her mortal champion. Now you must rise from broken raider to Jarl of Krokr \u2014 conquering rivals, bending the village to your will, and serving a goddess who expects absolute obedience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the Age of the Vikings.<br>Steel. Blood. Desire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 Rise to Power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774580/extras/bdefdfc138af8c80f0e44451efe132a3.poster.avif?t=1772209575\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774580/extras/bdefdfc138af8c80f0e44451efe132a3.webm?t=1772209575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774580/extras/bdefdfc138af8c80f0e44451efe132a3.mp4?t=1772209575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vikings: Sex and Blood</strong> is a story-driven sandbox visual novel where you control the pace of your conquest.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Love Points to deepen relationships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock all key characters to advance the main story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overthrow the cowardly Jarl Sten</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unite the island under your rule</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices determine who stands beside you \u2014 and who kneels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udda4 Women of Krokr</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every woman has her own ambitions, weaknesses, and desires. Focus on who you want, when you want \u2014 but to become Jarl, you\u2019ll eventually need them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774580/extras/68cb545255b0de1f20e188a40efd4be0.poster.avif?t=1772209575\" width=620 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774580/extras/68cb545255b0de1f20e188a40efd4be0.webm?t=1772209575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774580/extras/68cb545255b0de1f20e188a40efd4be0.mp4?t=1772209575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sindri \u2013 The Blacksmith</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strong, serious, and inexperienced in love. Beneath her hardened exterior lies a shy woman longing for affection and a man worthy of her forge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Freya \u2013 The Warrior</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fearless in battle, uncertain in intimacy. Raid beside her, earn her respect, and discover the softer side hidden beneath her steel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Yrsa \u2013 The Curious Sister</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Young, playful, and far more adventurous than she appears. Open-minded and eager to explore what the world \u2014 and you \u2014 have to offer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lei \u2013 The Rescued Slave</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grateful, na\u00efve, and slowly discovering freedom. Her loyalty grows naturally, but so does her desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774580/extras/82fafeb16e24b93cbffd2c58a3b2fd9c.avif?t=1772209575\" width=620 height=126 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And More\u2026</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the dominant goddess Hella and her ruthless priestess Astrid to the seductive Jarl\u2019s wife Kai, the clever advisor Hilda, and the guarded merchant Revna \u2014 Krokr is filled with women whose trust must be earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5,550+ high-quality renders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >680 animated scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ original soundtrack tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10\u201314 hours of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandbox progression with a central story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Love Point system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Political power struggle and divine manipulation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774580/extras/dba33142f847be8ab90427d6ac5ee82c.poster.avif?t=1772209575\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774580/extras/dba33142f847be8ab90427d6ac5ee82c.webm?t=1772209575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774580/extras/dba33142f847be8ab90427d6ac5ee82c.mp4?t=1772209575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to Expect</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark, erotic Viking saga about ambition, loyalty, and domination.<br